{
    "title": "Language Learning | Pimsleur",
    "description": "Learn foreign language skills in 51 foreign languages with Pimsleur\u2019s distance learning platform. Online language learning has never been easier than with our foreign language acquisition tool!\r\n\r\nWhether you're a beginner or intermediate learner, choose from 51 online foreign languages and start today. Our effective foreign language resources help you build confidence and quickly develop essential speaking skills through interactive distance learning.\r\n\r\nPractice reading, speaking and writing foreign languages like Spanish \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8, French \ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7, Japanese \ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5, German \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea, Portuguese \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9, and more! Remote and convenient language learning for any level!\r\n\r\nPimsleur as a Language Learning Resource\r\n\r\nPimsleur offers dynamic virtual language learning courses tailored for conversational fluency and AI-driven language acquisition, enhancing language learning from day one. With Pimsleur's language learning resource, you can seamlessly listen offline, converse in diverse languages, and achieve enduring fluency in 51 foreign languages!\r\n\r\nDiscover Pimsleur's fast language learning resource and start speaking a new foreign language after just one lesson! Our scientifically backed distance learning platform enables you to learn foreign languages in just 30 minutes a day!\r\n\r\nPimsleur offers online and remote training in specific areas, from memorizing vocabulary to practical conversation skills. This allows individuals to tailor their education to their needs and schedules. Pimsleur is perfect for learning new hobbies or advancing in your career, on the go or at home, with just 30 minutes daily.\r\n\r\nLearn a Foreign Language Fast with Pimsleur's Distance Learning Platform\r\nDevelop foreign language skills in 51 languages. Learn Spanish, Japanese, Portuguese, and beyond with our language platform. Pimsleur\u2019s online learning software accelerates language proficiency, enabling offline language transfer while on the move, bolstering fluency and self-assurance. Embrace Pimsleur's innovative language-learning platform today!\r\n\r\nEXPLORE VIRTUAL, FAST LANGUAGE LEARNING FOR FREE\r\n\r\nDiscover a new language with Pimsleur to achieve enduring fluency! Engage in a complimentary online language learning session in 51 languages. Witness our track record of empowering individuals to master Spanish and other languages!\r\n\r\nPROVEN METHOD FOR FAST LANGUAGE LEARNING\r\n\r\nPimsleur's hands-free, offline approach makes language learning easy and effective. This distance learning platform has helped millions achieve fluency in 51 languages. Using AI voice recognition technology, Pimsleur enhances natural language transfer, ensuring you improve quickly. Whether you're learning Spanish or French, choose Pimsleur for rapid foreign language acquisition!\r\n\r\nPREMIUM FEATURES\r\n\r\nCHOOSE FROM 51 LANGUAGES\r\nUnlock fluency in Spanish \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8, French \ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7, Japanese \ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5, German \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea, Portuguese \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9, and more for lasting language proficiency!\r\n\r\nCORE CONVERSATIONAL LANGUAGE LEARNING LESSONS\r\nEnjoy 30-minute conversational sessions anywhere. Quickly learn different languages & become a language learner in Spanish today!\r\n\r\nREAD\r\nYou won\u2019t just learn foreign languages like Spanish; you'll learn to read your new language without sacrificing speaking skills!\r\n\r\nSPEAK\r\nLearn to speak Spanish & new languages with role-play & review transcripts with AI language learning & voice recognition.\r\n\r\nSKILLS\r\nPractice phrases by topic & vocabulary flashcards. Learn languages with Quick Match & Speed Rounds.\r\n\r\nSYNC PROGRESS\r\nTrack learning progress across different devices, sync & stream offline with no ads. Learn languages without interruptions for effective language transfer.\r\n\r\nDAILY LESSONS TO BUILD STREAKS\r\nKeep your daily learning streak as you go and become fluent forever!\r\nFeature availability varies depending on the language. Visit our website for more information & a complete list of the different languages available for language transfer.\r\n\r\nCA Privacy/Info We Collect: Privacy Policy\r\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information: Do Not Sell",
    "descriptionHTML": "Learn foreign language skills in 51 foreign languages with Pimsleur\u2019s distance learning platform. Online language learning has never been easier than with our foreign language acquisition tool!<br><br>Whether you&#39;re a beginner or intermediate learner, choose from 51 online foreign languages and start today. Our effective foreign language resources help you build confidence and quickly develop essential speaking skills through interactive distance learning.<br><br>Practice reading, speaking and writing foreign languages like Spanish \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8, French \ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7, Japanese \ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5, German \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea, Portuguese \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9, and more! Remote and convenient language learning for any level!<br><br>Pimsleur as a Language Learning Resource<br><br>Pimsleur offers dynamic virtual language learning courses tailored for conversational fluency and AI-driven language acquisition, enhancing language learning from day one. With Pimsleur&#39;s language learning resource, you can seamlessly listen offline, converse in diverse languages, and achieve enduring fluency in 51 foreign languages!<br><br>Discover Pimsleur&#39;s fast language learning resource and start speaking a new foreign language after just one lesson! Our scientifically backed distance learning platform enables you to learn foreign languages in just 30 minutes a day!<br><br>Pimsleur offers online and remote training in specific areas, from memorizing vocabulary to practical conversation skills. This allows individuals to tailor their education to their needs and schedules. Pimsleur is perfect for learning new hobbies or advancing in your career, on the go or at home, with just 30 minutes daily.<br><br>Learn a Foreign Language Fast with Pimsleur&#39;s Distance Learning Platform<br>Develop foreign language skills in 51 languages. Learn Spanish, Japanese, Portuguese, and beyond with our language platform. Pimsleur\u2019s online learning software accelerates language proficiency, enabling offline language transfer while on the move, bolstering fluency and self-assurance. Embrace Pimsleur&#39;s innovative language-learning platform today!<br><br>EXPLORE VIRTUAL, FAST LANGUAGE LEARNING FOR FREE<br><br>Discover a new language with Pimsleur to achieve enduring fluency! Engage in a complimentary online language learning session in 51 languages. Witness our track record of empowering individuals to master Spanish and other languages!<br><br>PROVEN METHOD FOR FAST LANGUAGE LEARNING<br><br>Pimsleur&#39;s hands-free, offline approach makes language learning easy and effective. This distance learning platform has helped millions achieve fluency in 51 languages. Using AI voice recognition technology, Pimsleur enhances natural language transfer, ensuring you improve quickly. Whether you&#39;re learning Spanish or French, choose Pimsleur for rapid foreign language acquisition!<br><br>PREMIUM FEATURES<br><br>CHOOSE FROM 51 LANGUAGES<br>Unlock fluency in Spanish \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8, French \ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7, Japanese \ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5, German \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea, Portuguese \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9, and more for lasting language proficiency!<br><br>CORE CONVERSATIONAL LANGUAGE LEARNING LESSONS<br>Enjoy 30-minute conversational sessions anywhere. Quickly learn different languages &amp; become a language learner in Spanish today!<br><br>READ<br>You won\u2019t just learn foreign languages like Spanish; you&#39;ll learn to read your new language without sacrificing speaking skills!<br><br>SPEAK<br>Learn to speak Spanish &amp; new languages with role-play &amp; review transcripts with AI language learning &amp; voice recognition.<br><br>SKILLS<br>Practice phrases by topic &amp; vocabulary flashcards. Learn languages with Quick Match &amp; Speed Rounds.<br><br>SYNC PROGRESS<br>Track learning progress across different devices, sync &amp; stream offline with no ads. Learn languages without interruptions for effective language transfer.<br><br>DAILY LESSONS TO BUILD STREAKS<br>Keep your daily learning streak as you go and become fluent forever!<br>Feature availability varies depending on the language. Visit our website for more information &amp; a complete list of the different languages available for language transfer.<br><br>CA Privacy/Info We Collect: Privacy Policy<br>Do Not Sell My Personal Information: Do Not Sell",
